                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Have had ~10 sandwiches from here and tried most of the menu.\n\nI love pretty much all of their sandwiches. My favorite has to be the nice, fatty Taiwanese Pork Sandwich. The spicy pork sandwich comes in close second - This one definitely has some kick. All of them at least seem to be made out of very fresh ingredients.\n\nGenerally a great spot for a good breakfast/ lunch snack.\n\nOnly thing to concider ist that there might be a longer wait during rush hours.",
